# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local development secrets — copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in.
#
# `.dev.vars` is git-ignored. Wrangler reads it automatically when you
# run `npm run dev`. For production, push each secret with:
#   npx wrangler secret put API_TOKEN
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Cloudflare API token.
#
# REQUIRED for:
#   * The Live Browser panel (Browser Rendering Live View URL signing).
#
# OPTIONAL until you switch CHAT_MODEL or EMBEDDING_MODEL to a non-
# Workers-AI model in wrangler.jsonc — then it becomes REQUIRED for:
#   * AI Gateway auth (the `Authorization: Bearer` header).
#   * AI Gateway Unified Billing (the gateway charges this account's
#     Cloudflare credits for the model usage; no upstream OpenAI /
#     Anthropic key required).
#
# Create the token at:
#   https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
#
# Required permissions on the token:
#   * Account → Browser Rendering → Edit
#   * Account → AI Gateway → Run         (only if using AI Gateway)
#
# Use a custom token, NOT the legacy global API key.
API_TOKEN=

# Room token for the Live Market Room (/live).
#
# Visitors must pass it as `?token=<value>`; connections without it are
# closed in onConnect. OPTIONAL — when unset, the room accepts the
# built-in dev token `market-pulse` (see worker/live-market-room.ts).
LIVE_ROOM_TOKEN=
